DISPLAY: WIN_20230922_15_23_14_Pro.jpg
DELAY: 3000
PASS_FAIL: #5

#6: REMOVE THE SMALL DOMED MIRROR
INSERT THE FLAT MIRROR 
COMMAND: MLPRO2 BSIDEUV 0
DELAY: 100
