check all lights are off and click ok.
CLICK_OK:


#14: RING light RED
a. Check for 4 LED hot spots
IMPORTANT: You will see light reflections
b. Capture an image on the windows camera
DISPLAY: WIN_20230922_14_33_17_Pro.jpg
COMMAND: MLPRO2 BSIDEIR 0
DELAY: 100
COMMAND: MLPRO2 RING 100000 4095
DELAY: 3000
